        ('hiv_plhiv_active_care_0_14y', 'metric', 'PLHIV in active care (0-14y)', 'People living with HIV aged 0-14 on ART and in active care at the reporting month end.', 'Distinct HIV-cohort patients whose point-in-time HIV Visit status as of month end is On ART, aged 0-14 at that visit', null, 'tamanu', 'MSF', null, 'MSF OCA Standard Indicators Report (HIV/TB/PMTCT) operational definition', 'count', 'patient', 'facility_id', null, 'bes-maui', 'approved', 'specs/dbt-model/metric__hivtb_standard_indicators.md'),
